 "statements": [
  {
   "sid": "s1",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://hearinghighlights.com/hearings/119/house/house-armed-services/2026-03-04/speed-to-scale-revitalizing-the-defense-industrial-base",
   "text": "The nature of artificial intelligence introduces specific and very great vulnerabilities and the need for continued updates from the company introduces those vulnerabilities",
   "source_type": "reported_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Michael P. Duffey",
    "organization_id": "war",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s2",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.congress.gov/event/119th-congress/house-event/LC75935/text",
   "text": "Absolutely. It is a key enabler. And our adversaries, unfortunately, are embracing it, and so we have to move quickly to find out how we can apply it operationally.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Michael P. Duffey",
    "organization_id": "war",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s3",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.congress.gov/event/119th-congress/house-event/LC75935/text",
   "text": "There is all kinds of opportunities to bring how we do business into the 21st century, which I think is a key foundation to then finding ways to apply artificial intelligence internally to how the Pentagon operates, whether it is AI-enabled design where we could better optimize the systems we are developing or optimizing how we are expending our resources.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Michael P. Duffey",
    "organization_id": "war",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s4",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.congress.gov/event/119th-congress/house-event/LC75935/text",
   "text": "So what I think about, in terms of how to accelerate and improve the way we do our work, I think there is tremendous opportunity for AI. And then, certainly, with respect to enabling operations and finding ways to apply it responsibly in the deployment of our systems and in our operations is an area where I have less visibility and expertise, but I know we are actively pursuing opportunities to enable the warfighter who can help us identify ways to apply it to improve how we win and fight wars.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Michael P. Duffey",
    "organization_id": "war",
    "basis": "document_author",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
